      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edits an existing video using the replacement reference. MiniMax uses the source video for motion and scene guidance.\n\nSAM3 target and Preserve selections guide the input treatment. The Barn Owl example is trimmed to the first 3 seconds.\n\nSave Character stores the reference image and character description together. Select a saved character later to reuse both.\n\nThe example uses a fixed seed. Change Seed behavior to randomize to try new variations. It can take a few attempts to get the result you want.\n\nCreator's recommendation: the best local character-replacement option I've found so far.\n\nLoRAs: the public video-editing preset uses only Turbo V4 Step 600 pruned, at strength 1 with no trigger words. Add your own compatible LoRAs in the green settings panel; the list is applied once, with no hidden second Turbo. Use Trim video in Media, then Apply Trim. Launch ComfyUI with the included stability launcher after installing the listed requirements."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Edits an existing video using the replacement reference. MiniMax uses the source video for motion and scene guidance.\n\nSAM3 target and Preserve selections guide the input treatment. The Barn Owl example is trimmed to the first 3 seconds.\n\nSave Character stores the reference image and character description together. Select a saved character later to reuse both.\n\nThe example uses a fixed seed. Change Seed behavior to randomize to try new variations. It can take a few attempts to get the result you want.\n\nCreator's recommendation: the best local character-replacement option I've found so far."
      },
      "color": "#285b89",
      "bgcolor": "#152e45"
    },
